      ":question/problem": "Let $S=UV.$ What is the value of ${s}_{21}$, if\n\n$$\nU=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,V=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 3 & 4 \\\\ -5 & -6 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $U$ by the $1$st column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}_{21} & =\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 3 & 4 \\\\ -5 & -6 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right)_{21} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-6)+(-3)\\cdot (-5)+(-2)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =-30+15-6 \\\\  & =-21.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
